  ["re-frame.core" "register-listener!"]    {:tier :tooling :owner "009" :status "v1 (stream-parameterized: :trace dev-only, :events/:errors always-on, :epoch optional artefact; app-facing facade — home-verb tool-embedding form per Tool-Pair DCE tier rule)"
